# VibeGuard AI reasoning pass - configuration
#
# Copy this file to ".env" and fill in ONE provider below. Without a key the
# scanner still runs all pattern checks; the deep AI logic review just stays off.
# Your key and code go directly to the provider you choose and nowhere else.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Option A: OpenAI (recommended default - no cybersecurity content restriction)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
VIBEGUARD_LLM_API=openai
VIBEGUARD_LLM_API_KEY=sk-...your-openai-key...
# VIBEGUARD_LLM_MODEL=gpt-4.1            # optional; pick a cheaper model to cut cost
# VIBEGUARD_LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Option B: Anthropic (Claude)
#   Note: Anthropic applies real-time "cyber safeguards" that can refuse
#   security-review prompts unless your account is in their Cyber Verification
#   Program. If the AI pass reports it was blocked, use OpenAI instead.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# VIBEGUARD_LLM_API=anthropic
# VIBEGUARD_LLM_API_KEY=sk-ant-...your-anthropic-key...
# VIBEGUARD_LLM_MODEL=claude-opus-4-8
# VIBEGUARD_LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.anthropic.com

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Any OpenAI-compatible gateway (Azure OpenAI, OpenRouter, local Ollama, ...)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# VIBEGUARD_LLM_API=openai
# VIBEGUARD_LLM_API_KEY=...
# VIBEGUARD_LLM_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1
# VIBEGUARD_LLM_MODEL=...

# Set to 0 to force the AI pass off even when a key is present.
# VIBEGUARD_AI=1
